# Native Android Clean Architecture

Defines **presentation / domain / data** layering inside `feature/*` and `shared/*`. Module placement: `app` / `feature` / `shared` / `core`.

> Native Android only. Prefer existing project result type, DI (Hilt/Koin), and UI toolkit.

## Dependency direction

```
app → feature → shared → core
Presentation → Domain ← Data
```

| Layer | May depend on | Must not depend on |
|-------|---------------|--------------------|
| **Presentation** | Use cases, domain models, UI libs | Data APIs, DAOs, Retrofit/Ktor, `*RepositoryImpl`, `*Service` |
| **Domain** | Domain models/interfaces, `core` types | Android UI, Retrofit, Room, DTOs, Compose/ViewModels |
| **Data** | Domain interfaces + models, networking/DB/`core` | Presentation (ViewModels, screens, UiState) |

```
Screen → ViewModel → *UseCase → *Repository → *RepositoryImpl → *Service / *Api + *Cache
```

## Module placement

| Module | Owns | Must NOT contain |
|--------|------|------------------|
| `:core:*` | DataResult, network/DB primitives, design system, utils | Business rules, ViewModels, screens |
| `:shared:*` | Reusable domain + data | Compose UI, ViewModels, Activities |
| `:feature:*` | Presentation + optional feature-local domain/data | Cross-feature logic, deps on other features |
| `:app` | Application, MainActivity, NavHost, DI root | Feature screens, repository impl details |

- UI → `:feature:*` only
- Reused by 2+ features → `:shared:*`
- Single-feature logic may stay inside that feature

## Package layout

### Feature

```
...feature.<name>/
  di/
  domain/   # model, repository (interfaces), usecase
  data/     # remote, local, mapper, repository impl
  presentation/  # screens, viewmodels, states, components, navigation
```

### Shared (no presentation)

```
...shared.<name>/
  di/
  domain/   # model, repository, usecase (+ service/cache if needed)
  data/     # remote, local, mapper, repository impl
```

## Layer rules

- Use cases → repository **interfaces** only; `operator fun invoke()` for single-purpose use cases
- Prefer project result type (`DataResult` / existing wrapper) — do not introduce a second one
- Use `*Cache` / `*CacheImpl` — not `*LocalDataSource`
- DTOs, entities, DAOs, service impls stay `internal` in data
- ViewModels → use cases only; expose `StateFlow` / `UiState`
- Domain models: pure Kotlin — no `@Entity`, no network DTOs

## Anti-patterns

| ❌ Wrong | ✅ Correct |
|----------|-----------|
| ViewModel → Repository / Service / Dao | ViewModel → UseCase |
| UseCase → Retrofit Api / Room Dao | UseCase → Repository interface |
| `@Composable` in `:shared:*` | Presentation only in `:feature:*` |
| feature → feature dependency | Extract to `:shared:*` |
| Business logic in `:app` | shared or feature module |
